            "notes": "for round 7 my go to is [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) but if you bought that last round its [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9).\n\nIf you aren't dying that much you can choose, but I lean towards [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) since it helps your team a lot but i tend to forget its there most of the time.\n\n[Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) is a great option for staying alive, but if you have the money go [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) for more ap. You could always go [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) as it gives a lot of ap or [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) for wp but those are very pricey.",
